title: "AI Sociology"
abstract: >-
  An open research framework on human finitude, expanding generation and social order.
  Research edition 0.1.0 provides five bilingual volumes, 16 foundational principles,
  128 variables, 64 conditional derivations and eight illustrative formal models.
  Unvalidated mechanisms remain hypotheses. Historical software assets retain version 1.0.0.
